cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SkimGuard, please cite it as below."
title: "SkimGuard: a passive 13.56 MHz NFC reader (skimmer) detector for Flipper Zero"
abstract: >-
  SkimGuard passively detects powered 13.56 MHz NFC readers by sensing the RF
  field they emit, without ever transmitting. It provides an EMF-style meter
  with accelerating geiger clicks, a clean-vs-compromised A/B mode, a watch
  mode, and an off-device measurement/evaluation pipeline (detection range,
  false-positive rate, field-strength-vs-distance). It is an independent
  implementation of the passive reader-field-detection approach popularized by
  the open-source Specter project, with an added measurement layer and a
  physical-security-control framing.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Choksi"
    given-names: "Krishita Sanjay"
license: MIT
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-09-19"
